**Vulnerability Type:** **Propagation of vulnerable function calls**

**Issue:** This function calls the vulnerable helper functions repeatedly (lines 88, 91, 93, 99, 101, 107, 109, 113, etc.), amplifying the impact of the buffer over-read vulnerabilities.

