## 3. Vulnerable Function Calls and Callers

### Call Chain:
```
ixheaace_testbench.c (main entry point)
    ↓
ixheaace_read_drc_config_params() [impd_drc_user_config.c:74]
    ↓
impd_drc_get_integer_value() [impd_drc_user_config.c:56]
impd_drc_get_float_value() [impd_drc_user_config.c:40]
```

**Evidence from ixheaace_testbench.c:**
- Line 35: `#include "impd_drc_user_config.h"` - includes the header
- The function is declared in `impd_drc_user_config.h` (line 24-27)
- Likely called during DRC configuration parsing in the testbench

