## Recommended Fixes

1. **Add bounds checking to delimiter loops:**
   ```c
   while (i < sizeof(line) - 1 && line[i] != ':' && line[i] != '\0') {
       c++;
       i++;
   }
   ```

2. **Validate delimiter existence:**
   ```c
   if (i >= sizeof(line) - 1 || line[i] != ':') {
       return 0; // or error value
   }
   ```

3. **Bounds check before accessing `c[0]` and `c[1]`:**
   ```c
   if (c[0] == '0' && c[1] != '\0' && c[1] == 'x') { ... }
   ```
